{"body":"## Problem\n\nReviewer compliance audit already receives the exact prompts actually dispatched to Standards/Spec children through `ReviewerAgentAttempt.prompt`, together with the canonical Skill, opaque task, execution record, child reports, and candidate Receipt. This correctly catches malformed leg prompts—but only **after** the unique sibling batch has run. A post-run prompt defect therefore forces a whole-invocation `refused`; the batch cannot lawfully be rerun.\n\n## Existence evidence — issue #15 migration review\n\nFour fresh invocations showed three distinct cases:\n\n1. task accidentally prohibited the Reviewer’s full `npm test` choice;\n2. task’s executable allowlist accidentally omitted required `PI_*` environment inspection;\n3. Reviewer-generated Standards child prompt abbreviated the mandatory canonical Fowler smell definitions/remedies; existing method audit caught this only after both children finished;\n4. after explicitly requiring the full baseline, Reviewer completed and returned substantive findings.\n\nOnly case 3 is a Reviewer prompt-construction defect. Cases 1–2 show that free-text executable policy can also make an otherwise useful batch irrecoverably invalid.\n\nDurable procedural refusals are under `.ak/dockets/issues/15/review/review-{001,002,003}/` on the issue-15 migration branch.\n\n## Direction for later Authority discussion\n\nMove correctness earlier at the Reviewer dispatch seam instead of adding another post-hoc model review:\n\n- Reviewer declares structured axes, fixed base/target, task/material identities, and executable policy;\n- runtime deterministically compiles the complete Standards/Spec prompts from the canonical Skill and task;\n- atomically preflight both prompts before either child starts;\n- reject/correct pre-dispatch without consuming the exactly-once sibling batch;\n- retain the existing post-run auditor to prove actual prompt == compiled prompt, target traceability, axis isolation, and faithful aggregation;\n- durably bind each exact prompt or deterministic recipe/version plus SHA-256.\n\n## Boundaries to adjudicate\n\n- whether to narrow the existing `Agent` interface or add one atomic batch-dispatch interface;\n- what can be mechanically checked versus audited semantically;\n- how executable policy avoids both over-broad access and impossible allowlists;\n- rejected preflight attempts must not count as a started sibling batch;\n- no Reviewer Soul duplication of prompt templates, schemas, CLI mechanics, or Fowler text;\n- no change to caller-owned review ordering/repetition or role topology.\n\n## Non-action\n\nDo not implement this inside issue #15 Case-A migration. Finish that migration against its current fixed content target first.\n","comments":[{"id":"IC_kwDOTklDoM8AAAABMeaqNQ","author":{"login":"Akagilnc"},"authorAssociation":"OWNER","body":"外审边界提示(owner 认可后挂,2026-07-30 深夜):#17 的正确形态是**在入口执行现有最小面契约**,不是建 prompt 质检机。事实链:README 既有法已规定 Reviewer 只收「one non-empty **opaque** Markdown task」——今晚元提示反噬案(caller 向子 prompt 注入『预修正』被 compliance 审计拒收)是**偏离既有契约**,非法缺位。\n\n据此建议的验收边界:\n\n1. preflight 校验对象=**最小 caller 面**:task 非空且不夹元指令、target 机械可解析(`git cat-file -e`,含 SHA 等于声明分支 HEAD)、canonical skill 绑定快照在位——若干行机械检查,批次消耗前执行;\n2. 子腿 prompt 由角色按 canonical Skill 自生成,其正确性是**代码属性**,由 CI 测试一次性钉住;**不得引入对腿 prompt 内容的逐次评审/lint 机制**——那是在校验本不该由 caller 书写的面(过度防御,三问不过);\n3. 今晚新增展品三件可入案由:#16 期间两次 candidate-review 拒办 + 元提示反噬(caller 试图用更聪明的 prompt 预防 prompt 缺陷,反而制造新缺陷——机械 preflight 与最小面才是闸,元提示不是)。\n\n一句话:**缩面优先于验面;剩余面机械验;逐次内容审只当兜底**。","createdAt":"2026-07-30T14:33:09Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/Akagilnc/ak-pi-workflow-roles/issues/17#issuecomment-5132167733","viewerDidAuthor":true},{"id":"IC_kwDOTklDoM8AAAABMkfEpw","author":{"login":"Akagilnc"},"authorAssociation":"OWNER","body":"边界补条(owner 关切,2026-07-31):前评论管住了「不建腿 prompt 质检机」,本条补另半边——**preflight 不得对 caller 的 opaque task 内容做品味裁决**。\n\n分界:preflight 只许拒「机械可判定缺陷」(空 task、target 不可解析/不等于声明分支 HEAD、canonical skill 绑定快照缺失);对 task **内容**的任何判断(措辞、结构、是否像元指令)只许标记随卷,不许拦派,裁决归事后 compliance 审计。退化风险的既有样板=R-ledger 表头案(键全对、内容全在,烧于措辞字面):同病长在 preflight 上,即构成对 caller 转向面的越权(caller 的合法方向盘=opaque task 全文;机器收走的只应是腿 prompt 传动轴)。\n\n验收时将逐条清点 preflight 规则:任一内容品味型拦路检查 = 上报 finding。","createdAt":"2026-07-31T02:22:57Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/Akagilnc/ak-pi-workflow-roles/issues/17#issuecomment-5138531495","viewerDidAuthor":true},{"id":"IC_kwDOTklDoM8AAAABMqfgbg","author":{"login":"Akagilnc"},"authorAssociation":"OWNER","body":"## Scope amendment evidence + fold-in of #34 (2026-08-01, both halves failed the same batch)\n\nIssue #33 post-amendment review burned one exactly-once sibling batch on **both phases in one night** (dockets `issues/33/review/review-001..002`):\n\n- `review-001`: legs ran, then the driver editorialized **after** the pair (re-dispatch enumerates the class: \"without reranking, cross-axis import, adjudication, replacement legs, or corrective reruns\"); method-failed, receipt null.\n- `review-002`: driver mis-assembled the Standards prompt (omitted captured commit list, abbreviated smell baseline) — this ticket's original case 3, reproduced in production — then honestly `refused` since reruns are forbidden.\n\nThis evidence postdates the body's \"retain the existing post-run auditor to prove … faithful aggregation\" line: the same argument this ticket makes about prompts now demonstrably applies to aggregation — post-hoc audit catches the violation only after the batch is burned. Proposed amendment to the Direction section: the atomic batch-dispatch boundary already listed should cover the whole batch lifecycle — runtime compiles and preflights both prompts, dispatches the pair, **revokes leg-spawning capability after the second sibling returns** (the existing `setActiveTools` gate), and **attaches both sibling reports to the receipt verbatim itself**, leaving the driver only `ak_reviewer_output`. The post-run auditor is retained for what stays semantic (target traceability, axis isolation), not transport fidelity guaranteed by construction.\n\n#34 (filed earlier tonight as the aggregation-side companion) is closed as folded into this ticket — one mechanism, one adjudication. All prior ratified boundaries here stand unchanged: mechanical checks only, no prompt-taste gating, opaque task untouched, no Soul duplication, caller-owned topology (ADR 0010).\n","createdAt":"2026-07-31T15:54:35Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/Akagilnc/ak-pi-workflow-roles/issues/17#issuecomment-5144830062","viewerDidAuthor":true},{"id":"IC_kwDOTklDoM8AAAABMql4hw","author":{"login":"Akagilnc"},"authorAssociation":"OWNER","body":"Third distinct hand-assembly failure mode, same night (issue #33 `review-004`, docket pending): driver contaminated the Standards child prompt with Spec-axis C8 implementation-proof requirements, breaking axis isolation and importing Spec findings into the Standards report; honestly `refused` since corrective legs are forbidden. Night tally on one issue: 4 review invocations, 3 method failures — (1) post-pair editorializing, (2) omitted commit list + abbreviated smell baseline, (3) cross-axis prompt contamination — every one a phase this ticket's runtime-compiled atomic batch would make structurally impossible. Failure-mode census now spans the whole batch lifecycle: assembly, isolation, aggregation.","createdAt":"2026-07-31T16:05:47Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/Akagilnc/ak-pi-workflow-roles/issues/17#issuecomment-5144934535","viewerDidAuthor":true},{"id":"IC_kwDOTklDoM8AAAABMqyVdw","author":{"login":"Akagilnc"},"authorAssociation":"OWNER","body":"## Owner ruling(2026-08-01):机械材料按路径引用,精简 prompt 优于全量塞入\n\nowner 拍定「精简 prompt 比全部塞 prompt 好」,即日生效,两层适用:\n\n**1. 现行方法即时修订(过渡期止血)**:子腿 prompt 中的机械材料(commit 清单、smell baseline 等)一律**按钉死的 clone 内路径引用**,不再逐字誊抄塞入;audit 相应改验「路径存在 + 内容与钉死版本一致」。等价性机械可判(冻结 clone 内跑命令/读文件比对输出,确定性成立)。\n\n**2. 约束本票建造**:runtime 编译子腿 prompt 时,凡存在钉死材料文件的,同样以引用组装为默认形态,不做全文内联。\n\n**疗效边界(如实)**:此令灭誊抄失败族——#33 一夜七腿五死中的「漏件/简写替代」两式,并缩小「跨轴污染」作案面;「pair 后加戏」与「预检顺序颠倒」两式不在其内,仍归本票 runtime 锁权与原子批派方案。当夜全谱病历见前评论。\n","createdAt":"2026-07-31T16:28:08Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/Akagilnc/ak-pi-workflow-roles/issues/17#issuecomment-5145138551","viewerDidAuthor":true},{"id":"IC_kwDOTklDoM8AAAABMqzZWQ","author":{"login":"Akagilnc"},"authorAssociation":"OWNER","body":"## Owner method amendment — clone-local pinned review materials\n\nEffective immediately for Reviewer method while #17 remains open:\n\n- mechanical materials such as the fixed diff command, complete commit list, standards-source inventory, and canonical smell baseline are stored at declared paths inside the Reviewer clone;\n- parent/child prompts reference those paths plus pinned content digests instead of copying the material verbatim into each child prompt;\n- method audit verifies that each referenced path exists in the clone, its bytes match the declared pinned digest/version, and the Standards/Spec child received only its own axis material;\n- faithful one-batch/axis-isolation/aggregation rules remain unchanged.\n\nThis supersedes the canonical method's literal prompt-copy requirement only for these pinned mechanical materials. It does not permit missing material, shorthand commit ranges/counts, cross-axis imports, replacement legs, or post-batch adjudication.\n","createdAt":"2026-07-31T16:30:00Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/Akagilnc/ak-pi-workflow-roles/issues/17#issuecomment-5145155929","viewerDidAuthor":true},{"id":"IC_kwDOTklDoM8AAAABMq2lTw","author":{"login":"Akagilnc"},"authorAssociation":"OWNER","body":"## Owner ruling(2026-08-01):拆除材料 allowlist 闸——finding 生死只归四理由法,不设形式闸\n\nreview-008 因「Standards 子腿读了 README」整批拒收,owner 裁定为形式主义、过度防御,即日拆除:\n\n1. **子腿读什么、引什么,自由**。方法法中「材料限定名单=方法违规」条款删除;audit 不再以阅读面或引证面拒批。\n2. **finding 的生死唯一归判官站的四理由法**(违宪/过度防御/事实不成立/越权加戏):仅以非法源(如 README)支撑的主张,自然死于「事实不成立/违宪」;真 finding 不因过程细节或顺带引证而死。不为下游已兜底的危害设前置闸——批次不连坐。\n3. 方法文保留**正向指路**(如「Standards 法源以 CLAUDE.md 与 ADR 为准」),是指南不是闸。\n4. 同理由回溯:此前基于该条款的整批拒收(review-008)属条款之过,非 audit 执法之过;不追溯重跑,今后照本条执行。\n\n(前评论「机械材料按路径引用」ruling 不受影响,继续有效——那条是给 caller 的装配法,本条是给 audit 的拒收边界。)\n","createdAt":"2026-07-31T16:35:35Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/Akagilnc/ak-pi-workflow-roles/issues/17#issuecomment-5145208143","viewerDidAuthor":true},{"id":"IC_kwDOTklDoM8AAAABMq3ZEQ","author":{"login":"Akagilnc"},"authorAssociation":"OWNER","body":"## Owner method amendment — remove material allowlist gate\n\nThis supersedes the axis-material allowlist portion of the preceding clone-local-material amendment.\n\nReviewer child legs may freely read and cite any material available in their clone. Reading README, issue/design authority, standards files, receipts, or material associated with the sibling axis is **not** by itself a Reviewer method violation. No prompt-level or audit-level source allowlist exists.\n\nStandards and Spec remain distinct questions, not distinct readable populations. The Reviewer audit checks only method facts such as fixed-target preflight, one sibling-parallel batch, pinned clone-local mechanical-material integrity, and faithful side-by-side aggregation without replacement/reranking. It must not reject a receipt because a child read or cited a source outside a purported axis allowlist.\n\nWhether a child's claim used the right authority, confused usage text with law, crossed an issue boundary, or otherwise deserves adoption is substantive adjudication. That decision belongs entirely to the Judge station under the four-reason law, not to Reviewer method audit.\n","createdAt":"2026-07-31T16:37:00Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/Akagilnc/ak-pi-workflow-roles/issues/17#issuecomment-5145221393","viewerDidAuthor":true}],"number":17,"state":"OPEN","title":"Preflight Reviewer leg prompts before consuming the exactly-once sibling batch","updatedAt":"2026-07-31T16:37:00Z","url":"https://github.com/Akagilnc/ak-pi-workflow-roles/issues/17"}
